  "prompt": "Put each of the first 20 order lines in a value band. Use the sales table and keep the order lines with an order_line_id from 1 to 20, both included. Return three columns, in this order: order_line_id, net_revenue_eur and value_band. value_band is the text 'high' when net_revenue_eur is 500.00 or more, 'mid' when it is 100.00 or more but under 500.00, 'low' when it is under 100.00, and 'unknown' when net_revenue_eur is missing. Return one row per order line. Any row order is fine.",
